\par
     "Well, at least someone's sleeping," Taylitha said. "Any word on the native?"\par
\par
     "Speaking of not sleeping," Chloe said, shaking her head. "He's in Firebird Garden with the linguists and Thandry, one of our psychologists. Last I heard they were frustrated in the extreme. They should still be there."\par
\par
